{% extends "base.html" %}

{% block content %}
<section class="page-shell">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-card">
      {% if page_key == 'about' %}
        <h1>About FileSafe</h1>
        <p class="lead">FileSafe is a privacy-first document conversion utility built for public use across Europe.</p>
        <p>We believe document conversion should be simple, secure, and transparent. This service is designed for public use without logins, accounts, ads-based profiling, or long-term storage. Files are processed briefly, then deleted automatically after use.</p>
        <p>Our mission is to provide a premium, clean, and legally-aware document conversion experience that is practical for private users, students, SMEs, and public-sector workflows.</p>

        <div class="hint-box">
          <strong>Privacy commitments:</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>No personal data collection</li>
            <li>No user tracking</li>
            <li>No account creation</li>
            <li>No cookies for advertising or profiling</li>
            <li>Temporary file cleanup after conversion</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      {% elif page_key == 'privacy' %}
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="lead">FileSafe is designed to collect as little personal data as possible.</p>
        <p><strong>1. Data minimisation</strong><br />We do not require accounts, login, or profile creation. We do not collect personal information such as names, phone numbers, home addresses, tax IDs, or payment records.</p>
        <p><strong>2. No tracking</strong><br />We do not use third-party tracking, behavioural analytics, cross-site cookies, or advertising IDs to identify individual users.</p>
        <p><strong>3. Temporary file handling</strong><br />Uploaded files are kept only for the duration of processing. Once conversion is complete, temporary files are deleted automatically. We do not store uploaded content for long-term use.</p>
        <p><strong>4. Security</strong><br />Files are processed in a secure temporary folder using controlled validation and sanitised filenames. Supported file types are restricted to a defined conversion set.</p>
        <p><strong>5. Cookies</strong><br />We do not use tracking cookies. We may use a minimal session cookie only if necessary for technical reasons, but no advertising or user profiling cookies are used.</p>
        <p><strong>6. Contact</strong><br />If you have questions about privacy, contact us through the contact form or support channel listed on this website.</p>

      {% elif page_key == 'terms' %}
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="lead">These terms govern use of the FileSafe document conversion service.</p>
        <p><strong>Use of service</strong><br />FileSafe is a public document conversion utility intended for lawful use. You agree not to upload illegal, abusive, harmful, or infringing files.</p>
        <p><strong>Supported file types</strong><br />The service supports a defined set of document, image, and PDF conversions. Unsupported file types, hidden payloads, or unsafe files may be rejected.</p>
        <p><strong>File handling</strong><br />Uploaded files are stored only in secure temporary storage and are deleted after conversion. We do not keep uploaded content for long-term storage or future use.</p>
        <p><strong>Availability</strong><br />FileSafe aims to keep the service reliable, but we do not guarantee uninterrupted availability or error-free conversion for every file.</p>
        <p><strong>Intellectual property</strong><br />You retain ownership of your documents. By using the service you confirm you have the right to convert and download the files you upload.</p>
        <p><strong>Changes</strong><br />The service may change over time as features evolve, but the privacy-first intent remains the same.</p>

      {% elif page_key == 'contact' %}
        <h1>Contact</h1>
        <p class="lead">Contact FileSafe for questions, support, or partnership opportunities.</p>
        <p>Email: hello@filesafe.eu</p>
        <p>Location: Europe</p>
        <p>We operate as a public utility website focused on privacy, trust, and secure file conversion. We do not collect personal data through account creation or invasive tracking.</p>

      {% elif page_key == 'faq' %}
        <h1>FAQ</h1>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>Do I need an account to use FileSafe?</h3>
            <p>No. FileSafe is designed for public use without login or account creation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>Does FileSafe store my files?</h3>
            <p>No. Uploaded files are kept only temporarily and deleted immediately after conversion.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>What file types are supported?</h3>
            <p>FileSafe supports a defined list of document, image, and PDF conversions. Unsupported content is rejected.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>What is the maximum file size?</h3>
            <p>The maximum upload size is 100 MB.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>Does FileSafe use tracking cookies?</h3>
            <p>No. We intentionally avoid tracking cookies and do not profile users.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}
